{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜大致多雲日間乾燥　展望明日稍後起有驟雨\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261112-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。本港地區今日(11月12日)天氣預測，大致多雲。日間部分時間有陽光及乾燥，最高氣溫約27度。吹和緩東至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁。</p><p>展望明日稍後至星期六初時有驟雨，星期六稍後及星期日短暫時間有陽光。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T23:46:23.134748+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:03:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:57:11.407805+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:39:56.277901+00:00","content_hash":"43fdaf7754cff5ebb486d172257c0d913de2150ff2cb29985bc7d813ed5da8b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T23:46:23.134748+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}